{"server":"tw","storyId":"act21side_level_act21side_04_end","groupId":"act21side","stageId":"act21side_04","title":"苦夜驚雷","storyCode":"IS-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"e4bb3f00662cae070e73da4c629e46df7b7a0a740bb28ecb449199e5caebc2b3","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g4_srctheater"},{"type":"narration","text":"對她來說，她的生活方式是始終如一的，只是別人會因此說——\n她像個敘拉古人。\n她像敘拉古人嗎？\n她不知道。\n她只記得自己有一次和爺爺說過——\n“我覺得，那些認為敘拉古的生活更加高貴的人，和認為哥倫比亞的生活更加高貴的人，都很無聊。”\n爺爺哈哈大笑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今天，備受矚目的卡拉奇部長遇刺案件即將開庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，似乎是出於安全考量，只有少數被邀請者能夠進入法庭現場旁聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"其他人只能在法院外圍等待審判的結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在，法院已經被護衛重重包圍，但是，依然有許多市民聚集在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看來，卡拉奇部長的死還是牽動了許多市民的心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們會持續追蹤報導，請聽眾們耐心等待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"空，準備好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在演出的時候，你們兩個想去的話就去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正去了也進不去，還是算啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可頌","speakerId":"avg_201_moeshd_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，現在我們也只能耐心等待結果了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"能天使","speakerId":"avg_103_angel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在舞台上可要加油哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心吧，我已經做好心理準備了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女演員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"空，準備好了嗎？要報幕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空","speakerId":"avg_npc_684_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g3_srccourt"},{"type":"narration","text":"沃爾西尼法院"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安靜，安靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天這場庭審，結果將對所有沃爾西尼的市民公開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天審理的案件，是建設部部長卡拉奇遇刺一案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將犯罪嫌疑人帶上來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的看客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就是......德克薩斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聒噪的看客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那個髮色和瞳色，不會有錯！德克薩斯家的人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_692_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Zzz......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的看客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她怎麼會還活著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聒噪的看客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她殺了卡拉奇？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肅靜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"切利尼娜·德克薩斯，你曾出現在卡拉奇部長的遇害現場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我安裝了炸彈，在建設部部長路過的時候引爆了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好奇的看客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她就這麼承認了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聒噪的看客","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最後的德克薩斯......怎麼如此墮落！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的動機是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有動機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰指使你的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無人指使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，你獨自做了這一切？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的陪審團成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不可能！你從哪裡搞到的炸彈？又怎麼可能有機會安裝呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這重要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多疑的陪審團成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是來為德克薩斯家族復仇的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多疑的陪審團成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉維妮婭法官，我已經供認了一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾位坐在陪審團席位上的家族成員也實在太吵了一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的陪審團成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些多餘的流程，我們是不是可以乾脆跳過？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g11_mansionhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂，你怎麼還在這？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為，你會在法庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的意外嗎，德米特？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要喝點什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上的話，我建議不要喝酒，我來給你調一些提神的果汁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威士忌，最烈的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，回答我的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎麼猜到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很簡單啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我的襲擊也好，對卡拉奇的刺殺也好，都說明，有人想要十二家族互相猜忌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，拉維妮婭作為貝洛內在這件事上的代言人，一定要無法找到兇手，否則的話，事態也會得到一定控制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，在拉維妮婭逮捕切利尼娜後，對方一定不希望這場庭審進行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，拉維妮婭會遇上什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好，你沒有成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己可能沒有察覺，但她已經給你帶去了許多影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這讓你的行為開始愈發搖擺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而透過對你的影響，拉維妮婭自己可能也開始相信，自己是能做到一些什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須掐斷這種不切實際的妄想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真虧你能理直氣壯地說出這樣的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，萊昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不是心安理得做這些事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不希望等到一切結束的時候告訴你結果，讓你被迫接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你說得對，還好我沒有成功。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你還是做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這筆帳，我們可以慢慢算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說回來，切利尼娜在庭審前夕離奇死亡顯然更安全，但什麼都沒發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這說明——對方忌憚著切利尼娜的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟，且不說她是最後的德克薩斯，她也是老頭子帶回來的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，只有家族裡的人會甘心放過這個機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而昨天，切利尼娜確實沒有受到任何襲擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果對方猜到了這是你設下的陷阱而故意沒有出手呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果對方下定決心挑戰西西里夫人的權威，那麼，動靜想必不小，我也只需要查一查哪一家這兩天動作比較大就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而事實是，你，德米特里，在推動這一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不得不說，切利尼娜小姐會主動接受審判確實在我的意料之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原以為她有沒有被捲進來對計劃不會有什麼影響，現在看來，我確實應該把她的存在考慮在內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也不用妄自菲薄，如果不是切利尼娜主動說她願意背上這個罪名，對我來說，這麼做也是下策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說的話，你應該感謝她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然會感謝她。但是在那之前，我只想知道，德米特，為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是顯而易見的事嗎，我是家族的叛徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以相信所有人是叛徒，但唯獨你，我不會相信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我不能相信你，那我還能相信誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊昂，你怎麼看待這座新的移動城市？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......當然是新的利益分配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰能笑到最後，誰就是最大的贏家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說得很對，但在我看來，這裡是西西里夫人的一塊試驗田。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"借著建造新城市的名頭，讓十二個家族在這裡競爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新生代的狼崽子們可以在這裡宣洩被壓抑的血性，狡猾的老狼們也可以有一個新的目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多好，哥倫比亞家族的回歸，一下子就把敘拉古這一潭死水給盤活了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論誰最後勝利，對於高坐在灰廳之上的西西里夫人來說，都不是壞事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......難道說......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些年你做得很好，不僅壓制了大部分其他家族，也確實牢牢掌握住了建設部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣發展下去，貝洛內確實能夠笑到最後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，那又怎麼樣呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的家族在一座新的移動城市中獲得了絕對的掌控力，然後，一切照常進行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不甘心，不，是他不甘心對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自灰廳建立以來，自十二家族之間不得互相傾軋的規則建立以來，哪個家族甘心過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們曾經是無所顧忌的狼，百年前的家族鬥爭曾經不死不休。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而，新生代的狼崽子甚至已經習慣了枷鎖的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"習慣了和其他家族共存，習慣了衝突之後尋找和平的解決方法，習慣了在灰廳中和其他家族爭執所謂的利益分配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們本來沒有這麼做的必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，他想要推翻灰廳！怎麼可能？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一位允許各個家族各自為政，但她決不允許有家族違背她定下的規矩——家族之間不能有明面上的鬥爭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們即將取得勝利，也只有在這個前提下，我們的突然失勢才能夠引起所有家族的覬覦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬥爭是狼的天性，只要讓他們聞到血腥味，再溫馴的狼也會按捺不住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們會互相撕咬的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這樣，那位才會走出灰廳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我們等的，就是那個時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"“喀”，清脆的玻璃碎裂聲在安靜的房間中響起。\n而幼狼對被碎片劃破的傷口渾然未覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會笑到最後，萊昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到那時候，我們獲得的不是一座新的移動城市，而是整個敘拉古。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是你的父親，一手將貝洛內打造成十二家族中最為強盛的家族之人——貝納爾多·貝洛內想要做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有攔住你，不，你還有後手，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從一開始，你就知道自己的行動會暴露，所以你是故意在這裡等我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在這裡，是因為我覺得，我有必要面對你的怒火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應當向你請罪，無論是身為摯友，還是身為你的手下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做的事無法被原諒，但我至少不希望被你認為，我是心安理得地做下這些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"少在這裡發表像是勝利者一樣的宣言！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我輸了，真的，萊昂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但或許是敘拉古就是這樣的地方，又或許是，首領的野心是正確的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我就要承認自己的失敗時，她出現了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊昂圖索","speakerId":"avg_427_vigil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個瘋子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甘比諾，你能想像到的，讓一個人最痛苦的方法是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？把一個人的脖子砍到一半吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，卡彭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到他的親朋好友，然後一個一個地做掉，再把照片給他看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，所以我說，你們永遠成不了氣候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你又能有什麼高招？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信念，朋友，信念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毀了他的信念？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毀了？不，你怎麼能去親手毀了別人的信念，你做不到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要做的是輕輕一推，讓他目睹自己的信念從空中落下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，咻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"砰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"摔個粉碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個人的信念哪有那麼容易自己摔碎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，你不明白，信念是高潔的，而我們的生活卻是污濁的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“哪有那麼容易”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，哪有那麼困難？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以......這就是你讓我們準備一輛卡車的理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"甘比諾","speakerId":"avg_npc_542_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我懂了，所以你要去撞死那個法官，好讓德克薩斯動搖，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她像是會單純地因為一個人的死而崩潰的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡彭","speakerId":"avg_npc_541_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你要幹什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bar_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被薩盧佐除名的拉普蘭德，為什麼你會在沃爾西尼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你是如何回到敘拉古的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像，貝洛內和切利尼娜有誰也不知道的聯繫，我不得不承認，我和薩盧佐這個姓氏之間，也有一種令人作嘔的聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以，你代表薩盧佐而來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以這麼認為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建議你把吧台下的武器收起來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死在這裡對你和你的計劃沒有任何幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來做個交易吧，貝洛內的狼崽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是想要庭審中止嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來幫你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德米特里","speakerId":"avg_npc_690_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......阿爾貝托·薩盧佐的意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是他的女兒，我比任何人都瞭解他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是一直很好奇我回到敘拉古到底想做什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想做的事情很簡單，我要讓她明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敘拉古是一座泥潭，誰都別想輕易逃出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰都別想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g3_srccourt"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因此，你對上述行為供認不諱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"德克薩斯","speakerId":"avg_1028_texas2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在此，我宣佈，切利尼娜·德克薩斯謀殺建設部部長卡拉奇的罪名成立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"判決為——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的陪審團成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多疑的陪審團成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有聽到什麼聲音嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的陪審團成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......這是，引擎的聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多疑的陪審團成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡可是法院，怎麼會——"},{"type":"narration","text":"於曾經的家族們來說，心照不宣的規則高於一切。\n西西里夫人卻將名為律法的枷鎖套在了家族的脖子上。\n於是，每座敘拉古城市中都有一座法院。\n在敘拉古，法院的存在，代表著灰廳的意志。\n而法官，更是西西里夫人意志的代行者。\n法官往往不可避免地受制於家族，甚至臣服於家族，然而，每個法官都知道，他們有一條不可忘卻的底線——\n監視並預防十二家族之間的鬥爭。\n正如十二家族也都知道，他們的一舉一動，總是在西西里夫人的監視之下。\n於是，一種微妙的平衡，透過法院的存在被建立了。\n然而——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"像是在宣告著對西西里夫人的藐視。\n像是在嘲笑著敘拉古的法律本身。\n伴隨著轟鳴的引擎聲，以及夾在其中的高笑聲。\n一輛卡車破壁而入。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_i03"},{"type":"narration","text":"並且，即使在衝進來後，它的引擎也沒有停止下來。\n像是在告訴其他人——\n它並不是偶然為之，而是刻意如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻薄的陪審團成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噫——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"多疑的陪審團成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎麼回事？！為什麼會有卡車！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"車上的人是誰！立刻下來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，不錯，是我想要看到的表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什麼人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，日安，尊敬的女士們，先生們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請允許我自我介紹一番。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的名字是——拉普蘭德·薩盧佐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉維妮婭","speakerId":"avg_4065_judge_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩盧佐？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同時也是，"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"拉普蘭德","speakerId":"avg_npc_683_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刺殺卡拉奇的真凶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g10_smallrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"突發情況，突發情況！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就在剛才，有一輛卡車忽然衝入庭審現場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而做出這樣驚人之舉的人，名叫拉普蘭德·薩盧佐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"並且，她還自稱是刺殺卡拉奇的真凶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"目前，拉維妮婭法官已經中止了本次庭審，並將其逮捕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"收音機","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們會繼續追蹤後續的發展，請關注——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當所有人都不再將血腥味認為是血腥味時，血腥也就成了文明的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一次漂亮的警醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這座連下水道都已經滿溢著陰謀和血腥的城市裡，還能發生這樣的趣事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天生嚮往荒野的狼，你果然能為人帶來驚喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"文","speakerId":"avg_npc_694_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你又是否能掙脫自己的枷鎖呢？我很期待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"33_g5_srcpark"},{"type":"narration","text":"十數個家族成員躺在地上哀嚎。\n場上唯一站立著的，是一名拿著長弓的少女。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城市裡的狼，原來這麼軟弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿涅塞說得對。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她頓了頓，忽然，向某個方向嗅了嗅。\n那是法院的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座城市裡還有別的來自荒野的狼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，這不是荒野的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4014_lunacu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，很像。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
